flow-chart

direction right
typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel

Developer [icon: user, color: gray]
PullRequest [label: "Pull Request", color: blue]
Quality [label: "Lint + Unit + Contract Tests", color: blue]
Security [label: "SAST + Secret + Dependency Scan", color: red]
Build [label: "Build Once", color: blue]
Image [label: "Immutable Container Image", color: blue]
Scan [label: "ECR / Image Scan", color: red]
Artifact [label: "ECR Image Digest", color: purple]
DeployDev [label: "Deploy DEV", color: green]
Integration [label: "Integration + Security Tests", color: green]
DeployStage [label: "Deploy STAGE", color: green]
Performance [label: "Load / Smoke / Migration Checks", color: green]
Approval [label: "Production Policy Gate", shape: diamond, color: yellow]
Prod [label: "ECS Production Deployment", color: orange]
Observe [label: "SLO + Error + Business Alarms", color: orange]
Success [label: "Promote / Complete", color: green]
Rollback [label: "Automatic / Operator Rollback", color: red]

Developer > PullRequest > Quality > Security > Build > Image > Scan > Artifact
Artifact > DeployDev > Integration > DeployStage > Performance > Approval
Approval > Prod: Approved
Prod > Observe
Observe > Success: Healthy
Observe > Rollback: Alarm / failed health
Rollback > Artifact: Previous known-good digest

legend [position: bottom-left] {
  [color: red, label: "Security / failure"]
  [color: green, label: "Validation / healthy"]
  [color: orange, label: "Production"]
}
